comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T22:12:19.846Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched every status for nonexistent dependency, dangling edge, mutation-time validation, and GH-954. Closed pm-ol5v intentionally accepted forward references while adding downstream diagnostics; #954 requests a new fail-fast default with an explicit escape hatch, so this is follow-on work rather than a duplicate."
  "2026-08-10T08:26:22.351Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: local dependency targets now fail before mutation unless they resolve; external/global targets bypass local lookup; --allow-unresolved-deps emits deterministic warning receipts across create, update, update-many, CLI contracts, and MCP schemas. Focused lossless contract tests and the final full suite (468 files, 7141 tests) pass; clean-directory CLI acceptance covered existing, missing, opt-in, and external targets."
  "2026-08-10T08:36:14.115Z","harness:codex","Hosted static-gate feedback: contracts:check caught three new error catalog entries missing from the aggregate full fixture after later tracker/package integration. Regenerated the canonical snapshot with pnpm contracts:update; this is generated parity, not a hand edit."
  "2026-08-10T08:46:00.074Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit feedback implemented: unresolved target ordering now uses locale-independent code-unit comparison; the shared test factory opts into dangling targets only through an explicit override; the sole intentional missing search dependency declares that override. This restores default validation coverage instead of weakening all factory consumers."
  "2026-08-10T08:53:29.092Z","harness:codex","Review-fix verification: focused lossless/catalog/snapshot/search suite passed 71/71; repository coverage passed 468 files and 7141 tests at exactly 100% statements (50923), branches (37237), functions (10456), and lines (49265). Locale-independent ordering and conditional fixture opt-in are fully covered."
